      "text": "CI smoke tests create a repository whose path contains spaces and Unicode, run `init`, `doctor`, `list`, `show`, `status`, `input`, foreground/background `update`, lifecycle fixture flows including `needs-input` resolution, web foreground/background, autopilot dispatch/adoption/stop, and cleanup from the wheel.",
